WEBVTT

00:08:27.836 --> 00:08:33.092
Just as a six becomes a nine
when we view it from a different angle,

00:08:33.133 --> 00:08:37.304
a government deficit
becomes a financial surplus

00:08:37.346 --> 00:08:40.015
when we look at it
from another perspective.

00:08:40.057 --> 00:08:43.811
A deficit hawk might look at this picture

00:08:43.811 --> 00:08:48.315
and see nothing
but a sea of worrying red ink.

00:08:48.315 --> 00:08:50.651
That's not how I look at it.

00:08:50.651 --> 00:08:52.236
Here's what I see.

00:08:52.236 --> 00:08:53.904
I see what's happening

00:08:53.904 --> 00:08:57.408
on the other side
of the government's ledger.

00:08:57.408 --> 00:09:01.620
When the government spends
more than it taxes away from us,